<title>JAPAN: Eagle Industry - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Eagle Industry - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.18		vs	   15.38</p>
<p> Operating	  189    million    vs	  205    million</p>
<p> Current	    154    million    vs	  211    million</p>
